            </note>
            <note corresp="#d416-f4" n="4" xml:id="d416-f4-content">
                <p>The recommendation under reference took the form of a letter from Roosevelt to Bracken, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg848"
                        >p. 848</ref>.</p>
